e of visionary leadership. With clarity, courage, and compassion, Mr. Kaneda Hiroki has redefined what it means to lead. His belief that “cooking happiness through innovation” is more than a slogan, it’s a philosophy of action, aligning people, technology, and purpose. By merging bold innovation with cultural authenticity, Acecook Vietnam isn’t just evolving, it’s leading. And through that leadership, it’s delivering happiness – one bowl, one breakthrough, one future at a time.&nbsp;</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
